  "text": "proprium.dominica-post-ascensionem-postcommunio",
  "about": "The postcommunio of the formulary “Sunday after Ascension” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "Filled with sacred gifts, grant, we beseech Thee, O Lord, that we may ever remain in thanksgiving. Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Thy Son, Who liveth and reigneth with Thee in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end. Amen." }
